CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract foo
^\[w.assigns.\d+\] line 3 Check that \*p is assignable: SUCCESS$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
The write set argument of a call to a variadic function must be bound to the
write set parameter, not to the first variadic argument (here x).
